    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Apr 2026 10:16:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天聊</span><strong><span>【日】片野秀树</span></strong><span>的</span><strong><span>《低能量人有效休息指南》</span></strong><span>，这是一本2025年8月出版的关于如何休息的新书。</span></p><span></span><p><span>作者片野秀树是</span><strong><span>日本恢复协会</span></strong><span>的代表理事，提倡“休息是一门学问”的理念。为什么很多人整天似乎有在休息，结果看上去萎靡不振？而有些人看似不怎么休息，反而看起来精力充沛、生活丰富多彩？有没有一种可能，真正好的休息，看起来反而不像休息呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天的节目里你将听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span>什么是疲劳？什么是产生疲劳的五种压力？什么是自主神经紊乱的4种表现？为什么休息一定要变被动为主动？什么是给生活注入活力的7种好的休息方式？</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家都能好好休息，元气满满每一天。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>致 &nbsp;谢：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>感谢以下朋友的打赏：</span><strong><span>s流氓小丫头、晚河、小瓶_FWGi、一万六、祁莉莉ooo、文彦_SpCe、面包和牛奶、Jelly享健身、mmz_oNoQ、我叫王小勇、iam杨茜、怂倒菜菜子、热带低压_、途乐_ms50、HD587505s。</span></strong><span>你们的鼓励就是我继续讲下去动力，谢谢！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>相关单集：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/69c74222e2c8be3155b1369d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/69c74222e2c8be3155b1369d"><span>070 跟《反脆弱》学养生：拥抱波动、顺其自然的健康八法</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>《贪婪的多巴胺》</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/686a10af60f8f77d400fd632" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/686a10af60f8f77d400fd632"><span>上集</span></a><span>/</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/687370e260f8f77d403f12b3" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/687370e260f8f77d403f12b3"><span>中集</span></a><span>/</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/687ca16ea12f9ff06a0fa4a9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/687ca16ea12f9ff06a0fa4a9"><span>下集</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmwZ5CypsYaD5F4sTw7Q8H00Q-1A.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjpL5RfcR_NAv7_mbJX-ahqjdXJF.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsWjRH45DpCJ4tUYzdcPjr45BVpK.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="htt