  <item>
    <title>070 跟《反脆弱》学养生：拥抱波动、顺其自然的健康八法</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c74222e2c8be3155b1369d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69c74222e2c8be3155b1369d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 28 Mar 2026 03:04:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天继续说</span><strong><span>纳西姆·塔勒布的《反脆弱》</span></strong><span>，但今天不说高来高去的思想，咱聊养生。怎么运用《反脆弱》的智慧，让我们的身心更健康、应对极端风险的能力更强？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我总结了</span><strong><span>三个要欢迎的变化，两个要警惕的陷阱，两个心理认知，还有一个行动建议</span></strong><span>，总共八条，我把它叫做一套“</span><strong><span>八风吹不动的、不瞎折腾的、反脆弱式养生法</span></strong><span>”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你将听到的主要内容包括：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="349">00:05:49</a> 为什么反脆弱是“一把手工程”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">00:12:15</a> 健康不止需要复原力，更需要</span><strong><span>主动培养反脆弱性</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1090">00:18:10</a> 不要总想着消除身体的所有自然波动：我们要</span><strong><span>拥抱波动</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">00:27:40</a> </span><strong><span>适度压力</span></strong><span>是健康的必需</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2095">00:34:55</a> </span><strong><span>警惕"代理问题"</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2338">00:38:58</a> </span><strong><span>警惕医源性损伤</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2943">00:49:03</a> 用</span><strong><span>塞内加心态</span></strong><span>，既能享受物质财富，又能不被其所害</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3665">01:01:05</a> 接受生命的自然节奏，</span><strong><span>不必追求永生</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3987">01:06:27</a> 主动做</span><strong><span>小规模试错</span></strong><span>，在试错里拿到健康红利</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家都能从反脆弱的智慧中受益，都能有一个健康美好的人生！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>致 &nbsp;谢：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>感谢以下朋友的打赏：</span><strong><span>s流氓小丫头、小瓶_FWGi、一万六、祁莉莉ooo、文彦_SpCe、面包和牛奶、晚河、Jelly享健身、mmz_oNoQ、我叫王小勇、iam杨茜、怂倒菜菜子、热带低压_、途乐_ms50、HD587505s。</span></strong><span>你们的鼓励就是我继续讲下去动力，谢谢！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>相关单集：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/69be03ea2d318777c9f73dac" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/69be03ea2d318777c9f73dac"><span>069 不败之地：为什么《反脆弱》让我想到《孙子兵法》？</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>《黑天鹅》 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66d88623f39a2201c0728851" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66d88623f39a2201c0728851"><span>全集通读</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/67efdb6c0decaeb094ecdd9b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/67efdb6c0decaeb094ecdd9b"><span>重置版上</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/67efeaf9f9578163d606fe01" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/67efeaf9f9578163d606fe01"><span>重置版下</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoUlIzF3rbtDiDPyqY6Fjodcqd_T.png"></figure>]]></description>
